 "title": "DF005S to DF10S: 1.5 A single-phase bridge rectifiers, 50 V to 1000 V, in SDIP (PDIP-4 GW)",
 "source": {
  "document": "DF10S/D",
  "revision": "Rev 3, March 2025",
  "pages": 6
 },
 "summary": "A family of single-phase full-wave bridges, four glass-passivated diodes in a four-lead surface-mount SDIP package (PDIP-4 GW, case 709AE). The seven grades share 1.5 A average output at 40 °C ambient, a 50 A half-sine surge rating and at most 1.1 V forward drop per diode at 1.5 A; they differ in repetitive reverse voltage, from 50 V (DF005S) to 1000 V (DF10S). DF04S is the 400 V grade. DF005S is discontinued.",
 "key_figures": [
